@host = http://localhost:5256

### List orders
GET {{host}}/orders
Accept: application/json

###

### Get a known order (id=42)
GET {{host}}/orders/42
Accept: application/json

###

### Get an unknown order — triggers 404, sampler keeps it
GET {{host}}/orders/99
Accept: application/json

###

### Create an order — includes sub-timer for db.insert
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product": "Widget C",
  "quantity": 3,
  "customerId": "cust_abc123"
}

###

### Trigger an unhandled error — sampler always keeps errors
GET {{host}}/error

###
